{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo3.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they least expect it, the villain fires a beam that opens portals on Mr. Lon\u2019s ranch and the neighboring farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo2.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chupacabras, Barataliens, Vespaliens, Ogralines, and other abominable enemies spread across the ranches, causing chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/Galis.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo1.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it\u2019s up to Lucas to mount a defense against the alien hordes to save the chickens from being destroyed by the <strong>Chicken Coop Invaders</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense FPS action mechanics with Tower Defense elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 different invasion levels (plus one ultra-secret stage to unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">410 chickens to save!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682920?t=1745517177","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3682920?t=1745517177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/738c2dca26d33ec90d2c64e35d67ccaac0d5e6ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745517177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/738c2dca26d33ec90d2c64e35d67ccaac0d5e6ce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745517177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo3.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When they least expect it, the villain fires a beam that opens portals on Mr. Lon\u2019s ranch and the neighboring farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo2.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chupacabras, Barataliens, Vespaliens, Ogralines, and other abominable enemies spread across the ranches, causing chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/Galis.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo1.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now it\u2019s up to Lucas to mount a defense against the alien hordes to save the chickens from being destroyed by the <strong>Chicken Coop Invaders</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/TK_Sfundo.png?t=1745517177\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense FPS action mechanics with Tower Defense elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 different invasion levels (plus one ultra-secret stage to unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">410 chickens to save!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Miris Mind"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/7921bcf945ae5ae3e069d8532e56ce47e00bceb7/header.jpg?t=1745517177","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257127910,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127910/movie480.mp4?t=1745517175","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257127910/movie_max.mp4?t=1745517175"},"name":"Trailer - Gameplay","thumbnail":